        "subject": "LU-19836 tests: skip recovery-small 17b 26b for old clients",
        "message": "LU-19836 tests: skip recovery-small 17b 26b for old clients\n\nInterop sessions run the old branch's recovery-small.sh against\nmaster servers. test_17b finds several ldlm_enqueue_min files under\n/sys on master servers and fails restoring the saved value, and\ntest_26b waits too short for eviction by the master evictor timing.\nMaster fixed both (LU-19325, LU-19836), and the old branches do not\nhave those fixes.\n\nAdd recovery-small.ex so clients older than the test fixes skip\n17b and 26b when running against these servers.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ib35b9443c4e4cf7dd98110a84f814ba2db49f8ac\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
